cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "total-agent-memory"
abstract: >-
  A local, reproducible long-term memory server for AI coding agents.
  It stores decisions, solutions, facts and session summaries in a local
  SQLite store and returns them to any Model Context Protocol (MCP) client
  through hybrid retrieval (BM25, dense embeddings, fuzzy matching and a
  knowledge graph fused with reciprocal rank fusion).
